# Not a song -- a probe.
#
# The same diminished shape walked up the whole keyboard, so you can hear
# where the fit holds together and where it comes apart. The bottom octaves
# are where the reconstruction has the least room to work: there are only a
# handful of keys below A0, so almost every contributor has to come from above.

tempo 126
meter 4

track probe
  A0:q C1 D#1 F#1  | A1 C2 D#2 F#2
  A2 C3 D#3 F#3    | A3 C4 D#4 F#4
  A4 C5 D#5 F#5    | A5 C6 D#6 F#6
  A6 C7 D#7 F#7    | A7 C8 -:h
